end="0:26.440">nan</span><span begin="0:26.440" end="0:26.670">te </span><span begin="0:26.670" end="0:26.840">ka</span><span begin="0:26.840" end="0:27.010">ke</span><span begin="0:27.010" end="0:27.240">ru ko</span><span begin="0:27.240" end="0:27.520">to </span><span begin="0:27.520" end="0:27.670">mo </span><span begin="0:27.670" end="0:27.930">na ku</span></text><text for="L12"><span begin="0:27.927" end="0:28.297">kimi </span><span begin="0:28.297" end="0:28.417">no </span><span begin="0:28.417" end="0:28.717">te </span><span begin="0:28.717" end="0:28.827">o </span><span begin="0:28.827" end="0:29.087">hi i</span><span begin="0:29.087" end="0:29.197">te </span><span begin="0:29.197" end="0:29.367">ki</span><span begin="0:29.367" end="0:29.477">zu</span><span begin="0:29.477" end="0:29.837">ke</span><span begin="0:29.837" end="0:30.067">ba </span><span begin="0:30.067" end="0:30.387">ona</span><span begin="0:30.387" end="0:30.627">ji </span><span begin="0:30.627" end="0:31.057">yoru </span><span begin="0:31.057" end="0:31.267">e</span></text><text for="L13"><span begin="0:31.481" end="0:31.831">shou</span><span begin="0:31.831" end="0:32.241">setsu </span><span begin="0:32.241" end="0:32.361">o </span><span begin="0:32.361" end="0:32.731">ta da </span><span begin="0:32.731" end="0:33.011">kiza</span><span begin="0:33.011" end="0:33.151">mu </span><span begin="0:33.151" end="0:33.391">you</span><span begin="0:33.391" end="0:33.491">ni </span><span begin="0:33.491" end="0:33.871">sot to </span><span begin="0:33.871" end="0:34.321">hibi i</span><span begin="0:34.321" end="0:34.651">te ru</span></text><text for="L14"><span begin="0:34.657" end="0:34.917">kishi</span><span begin="0:34.917" end="0:35.017">mi </span><span begin="0:35.017" end="0:35.127">yu</span><span begin="0:35.127" end="0:35.457">re ru </span><span begin="0:35.457" end="0:35.767">shin</span><span begin="0:35.767" end="0:35.897">gu</span><span begin="0:35.897" end="0:36.097">ru </span><span begin="